{
  "name": "Cloud Office Print - Password protect documents from Google Sheets + Drive",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Password protect Office documents, one password per row\n\n**Before running:** set your credential on every Cloud Office Print, Google Drive and Google Sheets node, one by one. n8n does not copy credentials across imported nodes. Then pick your own files in the empty File and Document fields.\n\nReads a spreadsheet of documents and passwords, downloads each document from Drive, locks it with that row's password, and uploads the protected copy.\n\n### Setup\n1. Import `docs/assets/data/protect-jobs.csv` into a Google Sheet, tab name `Protect Jobs`.\n2. Upload the documents you want to protect to Drive.\n3. Paste each file's Drive ID into the `file_id` column.",
        "height": 446,
        "width": 1940,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        0
      ],
      "id": "0d83d144-6e97-41ec-8197-ea2ddfc95a93",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Office overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        1073
      ],
      "id": "86f4638d-0ea9-4990-8bc4-c674c12a6d04",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trigger\n\nRuns on demand.\n\nFor a monthly payroll run, use a Schedule Trigger.",
        "height": 557,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        476
      ],
      "id": "032c152b-8f7a-4ea4-8353-27f5a3c1e9f5",
      "name": "Sticky Note - When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Protect Jobs",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        280,
        1073
      ],
      "id": "58aad55e-cf9c-44ba-8d22-0562b5af1a72",
      "name": "Get documents to protect"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Get the job list\n\nGoogle Sheets, operation Get Row(s) in Sheet.\n\n**Pick the spreadsheet.** The Document field is empty on import. Click it and choose your protect jobs spreadsheet. Leave Sheet on `Protect Jobs`.\n\nColumns: `employee_name`, `file_id`, `file_type`, `password`.\n\nEvery row becomes one item, so the nodes after this run once per document. No loop node needed.",
        "height": 557,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        476
      ],
      "id": "c08b3dba-9159-4218-8adb-3d1cda4b42cf",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Get documents to protect"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.file_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "binaryPropertyName": "data"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        560,
        1073
      ],
      "id": "799724d8-c0c6-4023-8ac2-88ada6f1d47c",
      "name": "Download document from Drive"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Get each file\n\nGoogle Drive, operation Download File.\n\nFile is set to By ID with `{{ $json.file_id }}`, so a different file is fetched for each row.\n\nThe ID is the middle part of a Drive link: `drive.google.com/file/d/<ID>/view`.",
        "height": 557,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        476
      ],
      "id": "66eab307-490f-49e5-89b0-cf72de7bb691",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Download document from Drive"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "binaryToPropery",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "destinationKey": "documentBase64",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        840,
        1073
      ],
      "id": "beec1a3d-9fab-41cc-88b5-1df90d0e0709",
      "name": "Document as Base64"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Binary to Base64\n\nExtract from File, operation Move File to Base64 String.\n\nDestination Output Field: `documentBase64`",
        "height": 557,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        820,
        476
      ],
      "id": "a7f7db5f-32db-47dc-83b5-d7a66e4493b5",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Document as Base64"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "protectDocument",
        "operation": "protectOfficeDocument",
        "fileData": "={{ $json.documentBase64 }}",
        "mimeType": "docx",
        "read_password": "={{ $('Get documents to protect').item.json.password }}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cloudofficeprint.cloudOfficePrint",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        1073
      ],
      "id": "c3bdf47d-a011-4425-808a-2363f5b09ea0",
      "name": "Password protect the document"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lock it\n\nResource Password Protect Document, operation Password Protect Office Documents.\n\nBase64 Encoded File: `{{ $json.documentBase64 }}`\n\nFile Type: `docx`. Also accepts xlsx and pptx. To drive it from the sheet, put `{{ $('Get documents to protect').item.json.file_type }}` here.\n\nPassword: `{{ $('Get documents to protect').item.json.password }}`. `.item` picks the password for this document.",
        "height": 557,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        476
      ],
      "id": "9439d5a6-2323-47cb-8458-15c87ef85b70",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Password protect the document"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "body",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ $('Get documents to protect').item.json.employee_name }} - protected.docx",
          "mimeType": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        1073
      ],
      "id": "146936b1-9205-4148-8d17-bc6ffd41ba54",
      "name": "Base64 result to DOCX file"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Base64 to file\n\nConvert to File, operation Move Base64 String to File.\n\nSet MIME Type to the Word type so Drive shows the right icon:\n`application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document`",
        "height": 557,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1380,
